(•  Executive Summary:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.216 g
42.5196850393700814 482.4569291338582389 Td
(DealProof AI is a mobile-first legal technology platform designed specifically for India's informal commercial manufacturing) Tj
T* (clusters \(such as the Bengaluru Peenya/Chickpet garment corridor and Tirupur knitwear belt\). It ingests informal vernacular) Tj
T* (WhatsApp negotiations \(in Hindi, Kannada, and Indian English\) and voice notes, parses them through a two-layer architecture) Tj
T* (\(lightweight Gemini 2.5 Flash extraction + deterministic TypeScript statutory engine\), neutralizes common predatory commercial) Tj
T* (traps, and exports an enforceable, two-page Digital Order Slip with a cryptographic evidence certificate under Section 63 of the) Tj
T* (*Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam, 2023* \(BSA\).) Tj
ET
