42.5196850393700814 304.1577165354329964 Td
(1. Informal Job-Workers & Karigars: Tailors, embroiderers, weavers, and small-batch fabricators who negotiate job-work orders) Tj
T* (via WhatsApp text and audio voice notes.) Tj
